{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>single-player role-playing game (RPG)</strong> set in a vast fantasy world where the continent is composed of numerous plates. Humans have established their homeland on the Forgotten Plains\u2014this is where the story begins. You will become an adventurer, gradually exploring this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content included in the trial version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version only unlocks the <strong>Forgotten Plains</strong> area, accounting for about <strong>15%</strong> of the full game's content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ main and side quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich variety of <strong>weapons and equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3-4 boss battles</strong> to experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trial version gameplay duration: approximately <strong>1-2 hours</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658700?t=1746084554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658700?t=1746084554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658700/d926163214e79d3f3393e19269cbfe3d73499407/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746084554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658700/d926163214e79d3f3393e19269cbfe3d73499407/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746084554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>single-player role-playing game (RPG)</strong> set in a vast fantasy world where the continent is composed of numerous plates. Humans h